<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Harden signed a three-year contract worth <strong>$96.54m</strong> with Cleveland in 2026 under Bird rights, fully guaranteed, with a 15% trade bonus.</p>
<p>The last season is a player option with a deadline of June 29, 2028. He would become an unrestricted free agent in 2029 at 39.</p>

