</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Harden’s net worth is published at around <strong>$165m</strong> by Celebrity Net Worth, which is about 37% of the <strong>$444.42m</strong> he has been paid in salary.</p>
<p>He played three seasons at Arizona State and <a href="/teams/oklahoma-city-thunder/">Oklahoma City</a> took him third in 2009. He has been paid by six clubs, more than any other player on this payroll.</p>

