<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/james-harden/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/james-harden/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is James Harden’s Salary at Cleveland in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Harden earns $30.65m in 2026-27, third at Cleveland and the first year of a new contract. He was paid $39.45m last season. His career earnings reach $444.42m across eighteen seasons, the largest total on this site. The salary is 14.83% of the club’s $206.73m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for James Harden Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Two seasons remain after this one, worth about $65.89m between them, and the second is a player option with a deadline of June 29, 2028. He turns 40 in the summer of 2029."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does James Harden Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $30.65m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is James Harden’s Contract at Cleveland?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Harden signed a three-year contract worth $96.54m with Cleveland in 2026 under Bird rights, fully guaranteed, with a 15% trade bonus. The last season is a player option with a deadline of June 29, 2028. He would become an unrestricted free agent in 2029 at 39."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is James Harden’s Net Worth Today?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Harden’s net worth is published at around $165m by Celebrity Net Worth, which is about 37% of the $444.42m he has been paid in salary. He played three seasons at Arizona State and Oklahoma City took him third in 2009. He has been paid by six clubs, more than any other player on this payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is James Harden on $30.65m in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Harden is paid $30.65m because a former Most Valuable Player who still creates offense for a whole team is worth a large number, and 37 is old enough to bring it down. This is the lowest salary he has been paid since 2018-19."}}]}</script>
